WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Look from your left eye to your right in a mirror.
You may never see your own pupils travel.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Someone watching you does. The movement happened.
Your experience skipped the transit.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Researchers call one part of this saccadic suppression.
It is selective, not a total brain blackout.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
A useful question follows: how much of a seamless
scene did you consciously witness?

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
That science doesn't prove a meditation audio works.
What do you actually receive?

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Start with a free twelve-minute routine.
Compare the recordings and claims before any purchase.
